## Booking and Service Area

Our services focus on Malaga and extend to Granada for rentals over 400 euros. There is no fixed booking window, only availability, so reach out once your guest count, venue and date are confirmed and we can tell you which package actually fits your day.

## Conclusion

Choosing wedding rentals from a single trade AV company is narrower than choosing from a full service catalog, and that is the point. Guest count decides the package first, venue type shapes the setup, a house PA rarely changes what you still need, and wanting a technician is the same guest count question asked again. From there, vetting a provider and timing your booking are their own separate steps with their own guides. [Contact us](/contact/) for a straight answer on which package fits your wedding.

## FAQs

### How do I know which wedding rental package I need?

Start with guest count: up to 50 points to the [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/), up to 80 points to the [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/). See Step 1 above for the full comparison table.

### Does it matter if my wedding is indoor or outdoor?

Yes, for how the package gets set up, though not usually for which package you book. See our [indoor](/blog/indoor-wedding-rental-essentials/) and [outdoor](/blog/outdoor-wedding-rental-considerations/) guides for the acoustics, power and curfew questions specific to each.

### My venue already has speakers. Do I still need to rent sound?

Often yes, for the parts a house system usually cannot cover, wedding sized lighting, wireless microphones and a technician among them. Our [tips for reducing wedding rental costs](/blog/tips-for-reducing-wedding-rental-costs/) guide covers this question in full.

### Do I need a live technician, or can I run the sound myself?

That is the same choice as Eco Pack versus Wedding Pack. The [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/) is self run after our crew sets it up. The [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/) includes a technician throughout. See Step 4 above.

### What should I ask before I actually book a provider?

That is a separate step from choosing a package. See our [questions to ask a wedding rental company](/blog/questions-to-ask-wedding-rental-companies/) guide for the four questions worth asking any provider, including MEG.

### How far in advance should I book?

There is no fixed rule, only availability, tightest in peak season. See our [booking timeline](/blog/timeline-for-booking-wedding-rentals/) guide.

### What if my guest count is over 80?

[Contact us](/contact/) directly. Neither package is built to scale past 80 guests, and we would rather tell you that plainly than have you assume the Wedding Pack stretches further than it does.
